	And I assign the support user with the email address "passport.partner1@pspartner.com.broken" to the support role "Partner"
	And I assign the support user with the email address "passport.partner1@pspartner.com.broken" to the support user group "partner"
	And I log out and log into the support homepage as "passport.partner1@pspartner.com.broken" with password "${staticSupportAdminTestPassword}"
	And I go to the Liferay University Passport Access page
	Then I should be able to the view the Liferay University Passport Access text for users with full access to the form
	And I request passport access with the following values
	| End User First Name    | Passport                               |
	| End User Last Name     | Partner1                               |
	| Company Name           | Passport - ${staticProjectName}        |
